            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>WakeBee 0.15.4</title><h1>WakeBee 0.15.4</h1><p>The menu-bar icon now takes only the space it needs.</p><ul><li>Removed the empty gap beside the bee when no session is running.</li><li>The green dot and its space appear when a session starts and disappear when it ends.</li></ul><p>End your session and keep the lid open during installation. Versions 0.14 and earlier require a one-time manual migration.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/jswladitya/WakeBee-Releases/releases/tag/v0.15.4">Installation and migration instructions</a></p></html>
]]></description>
